{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2023-01-17 13:25:00', 'title': 'T-MOBILE KICKS OFF 2023 AS THE NATIONWIDE NETWORK LEADER', 'text': "BELLEVUE, WASH.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NEW YEAR, NEW BRAGGING RIGHTS FOR T-MOBILE CUSTOMERS. T-MOBILE (NASDAQ: TMUS) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS NETWORK ONCE AGAIN EARNED TOP HONORS IN OOKLA'S SPEEDTEST® GLOBAL INDEX MARKET ANALYSIS UNITED STATES Q4 2022 REPORT. WITH TOP MARKS IN EVERY SINGLE CATEGORY FOR OVERALL NETWORK PERFORMANCE AND REPEATED WINS FOR 5G, T-MOBILE IS HITTING THE GROUND RUNNING IN 2023 AS THE NATIONAL NETWORK LEADER FOR CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE. IN ADDITION TO TOPPING NATIONAL RANKINGS, T-MOBILE'S NETWORK PROVED FASTEST IN 45 STATES AND THE DISTRICT OF COLUMBIA AS WELL AS IN 86 OF THE 100 MOST POPULOUS U.S. CITIES."}